# ---- QoderCN Agent SDK (real agent backend, CN endpoints/quota) ----
# Personal Access Token from the QoderCN console (service integrations).
# Leave EMPTY to reuse the local `qoderclicn login` state (~/.qoder-cn) instead.
# Server-side only. NEVER commit a real token, NEVER expose to the frontend.
QODERCN_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# ---- Storage ----
# Directory for the SQLite db and per-task sandbox workspaces.
DATA_DIR=.data
